### How to Test

#### 1. **Expiration Job:**
```bash
# Start application
./mvnw quarkus:dev

# Manually trigger job (dev mode)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/q/scheduler/trigger/expire-loyalty-points

# Check logs
grep "Loyalty expiration job" logs/quarkus.log
```

#### 2. **Checkout Integration:**
```bash
# Enable feature flag (SQL)
INSERT INTO feature_flags (tenant_id, flag_key, enabled, description)
VALUES (NULL, 'loyalty.enabled', true, 'Enable loyalty points accrual and redemption');

# Complete a checkout
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/checkout/complete \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-Tenant-Id: your-tenant-id" \
  -d '{...checkout payload...}'

# Verify points awarded
curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loyalty/transactions/USER_ID
```

#### 3. **Admin UI Tier Progress:**
```bash
# Start dev server
cd modules/core-platform/src/main/webui
npm run dev

# Open browser
open http://localhost:5173/admin/loyalty

# Look up a member to see tier progress
```

#### 4. **Run Tests:**
```bash
# Run all loyalty tests
./mvnw test -Dtest=Loyalty*

# Run fuzz tests only
./mvnw test -Dtest=LoyaltyFuzzTest

# Run integration tests
./mvnw verify -Dtest=LoyaltyLedgerIT
```

